      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "```\n\n2026.05.13 21:59:26 Warning    -  [TextureManagement] Could not download image https://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/image/file_89592f80-2fc8-416d-9868-46018a5a9bea/1/1024/ - HTTP/1.1 404 Not Found\n\n{\"error\":{\"message\":\"The thumbnail for that image is not available\",\"status_code\":404}}\n\n```\n\nI found something about the No Image Found in the logs.\n\n(different world tho, but yeah)",
