  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "1. Open VRChat\n\n2. Find a big world (depending on your internet speed)\n\n3. Preload the world\n\n4. Close the menu (ESC) whilst its preloading\n\n5. Open pause menu again\n\n6. See the notification at the top about the progress say \"No image found\"\n\nAt least PC is affected. Likely it is all platforms.\n\nHappens with and without open beta",
